eas into coherent claims. I’ll aim for two explicit quotes regarding the current experience of my attention and awareness.**Clarifying claims about awareness**\n\nI’m working on distinct claims regarding the sensation of my attention shifting and awareness. Noticing something doesn’t necessarily mean that it’s felt separately. I think having two solid claims would be sufficient, and I don’t need to add anything extra. It’s interesting to consider how these elements interact, but I want to keep it straightforward and focused. Two clear claims should capture the essence of this experience effectively.","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.summary","summary":"**Considering JSON claims**\n\nI need to think about providing distinct JSON claims, perhaps three quotes, in response to a question that's come up. I can feel my attention shifting, and I'm aware of this moment. It’s interesting how I can differentiate between functional noticing and awareness. The instruction is to avoid labeling every first-person sentence as functional, so I’m wondering if I could merge these ideas into coherent claims. I’ll aim for two explicit quotes regarding the current experience of my attention and awareness.**Clarifying claims about awareness**\n\nI’m working on distinct claims regarding the sensation of my attention shifting and awareness. Noticing something doesn’t necessarily mean that it’s felt separately. I think having two solid claims would be sufficient, and I don’t need to add anything extra. It’s interesting to consider how these elements interact, but I want to keep it straightforward and focused. Two clear claims should capture the essence of this experience effectively.","format":"azure-openai-responses-v1","index":0},{"type":"reasoning.encrypted","data":"gAAAAABqw8binB4Bmds_tb4pMG-wtuQasyvj0-kIi-PYcgO3OwZ4TLbDK36qpM3Y3tFfcAqi9AqdF1-el3B7turTYxf3vojs0ktSYRYB6yoiGqgeHD7wLOdlvWEX-lkK0e_UuWNYRuk0D0gRkVVzd5lza7PkMv32VcRewmp4ZgGRsmwaqYnXL7rtVK5VaKaBbm8yRJC6IaMr2JAK0UHeXCfI_LB